# FPM mirror candidate pool
#
# Large, curated pool of public mirrors for distributions supported by FPM.
# Only Arch, Debian and Debian-based Ubuntu, Alpine, Fedora/RPM and RPM-family
# repositories are included. Unsupported distro families were removed.
# Format: BASE_URL | Country | Protocol | Priority
#
# Mirror sources checked against current official mirror directories where
# available. FPM should still probe every mirror at runtime and skip a mirror
# if its repository metadata is unavailable.

